an class=\"k\">func</span> <span class=\"nv\">$i</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"run\"</span><span class=\"p\">))))</span>\n  <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"err\">instance</span> <span class=\"nv\">$b</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"err\">instantiate</span> <span class=\"nv\">$B</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"err\">with</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"take\"</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">func</span> <span class=\"nv\">$a</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"take\"</span><span class=\"p\">))))</span>\n  <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">export</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"run\"</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">func</span> <span class=\"nv\">$b</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"run\"</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n<span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"err\">assert_</span><span class=\"nb\">return</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"err\">invoke</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"run\"</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>fails with</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Rust\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"cp\">$</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">wasmtime</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">wast</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">W</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">component</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">error</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">context</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">repro</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">wast</span>\n<span class=\"n\">Error</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nc\">failed</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">to</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">run</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">script</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">file</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">'</span><span class=\"na\">repro</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">wast</span><span class=\"o\">'</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nc\">failed</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">directive</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">on</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">repro</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">wast</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"mi\">78</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nc\">error</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">while</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">executing</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">at</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">wasm</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">backtrace</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nc\">BUG</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nc\">retrieve</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">concurrent</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">state</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">for</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">error</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">context</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">during</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nb\">drop</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>An LLM summary, if useful, is:</p>\n<p>&lt;details&gt;</p>\n<p>When an <code>error-context</code> is lowered as part of a future or stream payload,<br>\n<code>lower_error_context_to_index</code><br>\n(<code>crates/wasmtime/src/runtime/component/concurrent/futures_and_streams.rs</code>)<br>\ninserts it into the receiving component's table without incrementing<br>\n<code>global_error_context_ref_counts</code>. The direct transfer path,<br>\n<code>error_context_transfer</code>, does increment it.</p>\n<p>So if a component sends an error-context through a future and the receiver<br>\ndrops its copy, the global count goes from 1 to 0 and the shared state is<br>\ndeleted while the sender still has a handle. The sender dropping its handle<br>\nthen hits a <code>bail_bug!</code>. If another error-context is created first, it<br>\nreuses the freed slot, and the sender's handle refers to that one instead,<br>\nwhich may belong to a different component.</p>\n<p>This requires <code>component-model-error-context</code>, which is off by default.</p>\n<p>&lt;/details&gt;</p>\n</blockquote>",
        "id": 631082990,
        "sender_full_name": "Wasmtime GitHub notifications bot",
        "timestamp": 1791830218
    },
    {
        "content": "<p><a href=\"https://github.com/alexcrichton\">alexcrichton</a> added the wasm-proposal:component-model-error-context label to <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/issues/14674\">Issue #14674</a>.</p>",
        "id": 631082992,
        "sender_full_name": "Wasmtime GitHub notifications bot",
        "timestamp": 1791830219
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>alexcrichton <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/issues/14674#issuecomment-6132567950\">commented</a> on <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/issues/14674\">issue #14674</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Perhaps a related issue is that <code>error-context</code> on the host has no reference count at all. I suspect there's a lot of issues related to this and we've generally just ignored error-context for now. This test however:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Rust\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"cp\">#[tokio::test]</span>\n<span class=\"k\">async</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">fn</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">host_error_context_outlives_guest_handle</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">-&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nb\">Result</span><span class=\"o\">&lt;</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"o\">&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kd\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">mut</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">config</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Config</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">new</span><span class=\"p\">();</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">config</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">wasm_component_model_async</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"kc\">true</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">config</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">wasm_component_model_error_context</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"kc\">true</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kd\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">engine</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Engine</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">new</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"o\">&amp;</span><span class=\"n\">config</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">?</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kd\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">component</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Component</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">new</span><span class=\"p\">(</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"o\">&amp;</span><span class=\"n\">engine</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"s\">r#\"</span>\n<span class=\"s\">(component</span>\n<span class=\"s\">  (core module $libc</span>\n<span class=\"s\">    (memory (export \"memory\") 1)</span>\n<span class=\"s\">    (func (export \"realloc\") (param i32 i32 i32 i32) (result i32) (i32.const 256)))</span>\n<span class=\"s\">  (core instance $libc (instantiate $libc))</span>\n<span class=\"s\">  (core func $error-context.new</span>\n<span class=\"s\">    (canon error-context.new (memory (core memory $libc \"memory\"))))</span>\n<span class=\"s\">  (core func $error-context.debug-message</span>\n<span class=\"s\">    (canon error-context.debug-message (memory (core memory $libc \"memory\"))</span>\n<span class=\"s\">      (realloc (core func $libc \"realloc\"))))</span>\n<span class=\"s\">  (core func $error-context.drop (canon error-context.drop))</span>\n<span class=\"s\">  (core func $task.return (canon task.return (result error-context)))</span>\n<span class=\"s\">  (core module $m</span>\n<span class=\"s\">    (import \"libc\" \"memory\" (memory 1))</span>\n<span class=\"s\">    (import \"\" \"error-context.new\" (func $error-context.new (param i32 i32) (result i32)))</span>\n<span class=\"s\">    (import \"\" \"error-context.debug-message\" (func $error-context.debug-message (param i32 i32)))</span>\n<span class=\"s\">    (import \"\" \"error-context.drop\" (func $error-context.drop (param i32)))</span>\n<span class=\"s\">    (import \"\" \"task.return\" (func $task.return (param i32)))</span>\n<span class=\"s\">    (data (i32.const 0) \"hello\")</span>\n<span class=\"s\">    ;; Returns a new error-context to the host, then drops its own handle.</span>\n<span class=\"s\">    (func (export \"make\") (result i32)</span>\n<span class=\"s\">      (local $e i32)</span>\n<span class=\"s\">      (local.set $e (call $error-context.new (i32.const 0) (i32.const 5)))</span>\n<span class=\"s\">      (call $task.return (local.get $e))</span>\n<span class=\"s\">      (call $error-context.drop (local.get $e))</span>\n<span class=\"s\">      (i32.const 0 (; EXIT ;)))</span>\n<span class=\"s\">    (func (export \"make-cb\") (param i32 i32 i32) (result i32) unreachable)</span>\n<span class=\"s\">    ;; Returns the length of the error-context's debug message.</span>\n<span class=\"s\">    (func (export \"take\") (param $e i32) (result i32)</span>\n<span class=\"s\">      (call $error-context.debug-message (local.get $e) (i32.const 64))</span>\n<span class=\"s\">      (call $error-context.drop (local.get $e))</span>\n<span class=\"s\">      (i32.load (i32.const 68)))</span>\n<span class=\"s\">  )</span>\n<span class=\"s\">  (core instance $i (instantiate $m</span>\n<span class=\"s\">    (with \"libc\" (instance $libc))</span>\n<span class=\"s\">    (with \"\" (instance</span>\n<span class=\"s\">      (export \"error-context.new\" (func $error-context.new))</span>\n<span class=\"s\">      (export \"error-context.debug-message\" (func $error-context.debug-message))</span>\n<span class=\"s\">      (export \"error-context.drop\" (func $error-context.drop))</span>\n<span class=\"s\">      (export \"task.return\" (func $task.return))))))</span>\n<span class=\"s\">  (func (export \"make\") async (result error-context)</span>\n<span class=\"s\">    (canon lift (core func $i \"make\") async (callback (core func $i \"make-cb\"))))</span>\n<span class=\"s\">  (func (export \"take\") (param \"e\" error-context) (result u32)</span>\n<span class=\"s\">    (canon lift (core func $i \"take\")))</span>\n<span class=\"s\">)</span>\n<span class=\"s\">        \"#</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">?</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kd\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">mut</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">store</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Store</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">new</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"o\">&amp;</span><span class=\"n\">engine</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">());</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kd\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">instance</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Linker</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">new</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"o\">&amp;</span><span class=\"n\">engine</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">instantiate_async</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"o\">&amp;</span><span class=\"k\">mut</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">store</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&amp;</span><span class=\"n\">component</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"k\">await</span><span class=\"o\">?</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kd\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">make</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">instance</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">get_typed_func</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"o\">&lt;</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">ErrorContext</span><span class=\"p\">,)</span><span class=\"o\">&gt;</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"o\">&amp;</span><span class=\"k\">mut</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">store</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"make\"</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">?</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kd\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">take</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">instance</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">get_typed_func</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"o\">&lt;</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">ErrorContext</span><span class=\"p\">,),</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"kt\">u32</span><span class=\"p\">,)</span><span class=\"o\">&gt;</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"o\">&amp;</span><span class=\"k\">mut</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">store</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"take\"</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">?</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"c1\">// The host still holds `e` after the guest drops its own handle, so</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"c1\">// passing it back should work.</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kd\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">e</span><span class=\"p\">,)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">make</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">call_async</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"o\">&amp;</span><span class=\"k\">mut</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">store</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">()).</span><span class=\"k\">await</span><span class=\"o\">?</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kd\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">len</span><span class=\"p\">,)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">take</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">call_async</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"o\">&amp;</span><span class=\"k\">mut</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">store</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">e</span><span class=\"p\">,)).</span><span class=\"k\">await</span><span class=\"o\">?</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"fm\">assert_eq!</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">len</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">5</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"nb\">Ok</span><span class=\"p\">(())</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>fails with <code>resource not present</code> currently.</p>\n</blockquote>",
        "id": 631109267,
        "sender_full_name": "Wasmtime GitHub notifications bot",
        "timestamp": 1791839011
